OL,3,GNEWSALandslide-hit road in Skye reopens
OL,4,Ato traffic
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road in Skye that was closed
OL,7,Ffollowing a landslide on Friday has
OL,8,Freopened to traffic.
OL,10,FDrivers were forced to make a 40-mile
OL,11,F(64km) diversion after the A855 was
OL,12,Fcovered in earth and stones at Idrigill
OL,13,FBends.
OL,15,FHighland Council says work to clear the
OL,16,Fdebris and stabilise other areas of
OL,17,Fground has been completed.
OL,19,FNo-one was injured by the landslip -
OL,20,Fwhich was caught on CCTV from a nearby
OL,21,Fhouse.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
